WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.211
Enter atom numbers in order for the distance, angle, and signed torsion. The

00:00:08.211 --> 00:00:12.000
middle atom is the angle vertex.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.222
Save the annotated PNG with the visible bond monitor. Export a CSV that

00:00:19.222 --> 00:00:22.000
retains all three measurement definitions.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:28.111
Ask for the three ordered measurements, including their units and statuses.

00:00:28.111 --> 00:00:32.000
The GUI and connector number atoms differently.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.429
The C1–C2 distance is 1.525 angstroms. The CSV keeps the angle and negative

00:00:39.429 --> 00:00:44.000
signed torsion even when their monitors are hidden.
